Thanks for installing Transient Sculptor!

Transient Sculptor is an adaptive, frequency-dependent transient shaper: it cuts
(or boosts) only the frequency ranges that contain transient material, leaving the
sustained part of the signal untouched. It was built with vocals in mind — clicks,
mouth noises and harsh attacks — but works on any source.

